WEBVTT

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:03.830
<i>We have breaking news!</i>

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:05.800
<i>Robbers attacked an armored truck</i>

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.960
<i>in West Silver, in the Stern Medaille area,</i>

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.510
<i>and made off with three million Stern dollars.</i>

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.060
<i>Oh no! The police car!</i>

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.730
<i>Will they let them make off with the cash?</i>

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.610
<i>We still haven't spotted any Heroes.</i>

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.560
<i>As all of you know, we bring coverage</i>

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.450
<i>of super-powered Heroes taking on crimes</i>

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:40.120
<i>and natural disasters, straight to your living room!</i>

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.960
<i>The rescue entertainment program</i>

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.250
<i>that rates Heroes by their actions</i>

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:50.130
<i>to pick the King of Heroes! This is HERO TV LIVE!</i>

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.310
<b>gokigen yo doukashitan darou?</b>

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.310
<b><i>How are you? Is something wrong?</i></b>

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:08.620
<b>kao wo mireba isshun de wakaru yo</b>

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:08.620
<b><i>I can tell just by looking at you.</i></b>

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:13.200
<b>senrigan senrigan? messou nai desu</b>

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:13.200
<b><i>Am I psychic? Of course not.</i></b>

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:15.830
<b>taikutsu GIRL megumaretai no kai</b>

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:15.830
<b><i>Bored girl, do you want to find happiness?</i></b>

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:19.200
<b>hantei wa shingi no renzoku de</b>

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:19.200
<b><i>Let's think it through and decide.</i></b>

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.660
<b>VENUS SUSTAIN</b>

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.660
<b><i>Venus Sustain.</i></b>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.480
<b>odoru machinami</b>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.480
<b><i>The city dances.</i></b>

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:25.840
<b>PERFECTLY EUPHORIA</b>

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:25.840
<b><i>Perfectly, Euphoria!</i></b>

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:31.830
<b>nandemo nai youna kotoba de naitari suru shi</b>

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:31.830
<b><i>I end up crying over the smallest things.</i></b>

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:34.640
<b>hora bokutachi nante</b>

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:34.640
<b><i>Come on, our</i></b>

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.740
<b>zentei no nai</b>

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.740
<b><i>temporary passion</i></b>

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:37.110
<b>juubun tekido ni</b>

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:37.110
<b><i>lives are</i></b>

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.380
<b>zentei no nai</b>

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.380
<b><i>a temporary passion</i></b>

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.950
<b>DRAMATIC sa</b>

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.950
<b><i>reasonably dramatic.</i></b>

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:40.970
<b>saikou no wa</b>

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:40.970
<b><i>the best passion</i></b>

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:43.810
<b>karuku SUPER STAR</b>

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:43.810
<b><i>We're almost like super stars!</i></b>

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:48.960
<b>ORION wo nazoru konna fukai yoru</b>

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:48.960
<b><i>Looking up at Orion late at night.</i></b>

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.700
<b>tsunagaretai hanasaretai</b>

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.700
<b><i>I want to connect. I want to be free.</i></b>

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:55.100
<b>tsumari hanshinhangi acchi kocchi</b>

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:55.100
<b><i>Basically, I'm not sure and can't decide.</i></b>

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:59.540
<b>shin mirai wo negau kuuzenzetsugo no</b>

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:59.540
<b><i>I pray for a new future. The greatest one yet.</i></b>

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:06.590
<b>kotoba ga moshi, moshi tsumugeru nara jikan ga tomaru yo</b>

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:06.590
<b><i>If I could spin words, time would stop.</i></b>

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:09.910
<b>koko de owaru hazu ga nai no ni</b>

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:09.910
<b><i>"There's no way it can end here."</i></b>

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:24.970
<i>And here comes one now!</i>

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.890
<i>It's Fire Emblem, the Bourgeois Open Flame Broil!</i>

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:30.780
<i>Will he be able to make a grand arrest today?!</i>

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:34.210
Get the camera up close!

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:35.570
Got it!

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:43.200
<i>He's caught up with the suspect...</i>

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:45.370
<i>with his skillful driving!</i>

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.540
They've already come.

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:49.040
Eat this!

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:01.930
<i>Yes! Is he going to use his Fireball?!</i>

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:06.890
<i>A merciless attack!</i>

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:08.560
Do something!

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:09.530
Shut up!

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:12.230
<i>The suspects are helpless!</i>

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:16.900
<i>And there's another one!</i>

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:20.070
<i>It's Rock Bison, the Bull Tank of the West Coast!</i>

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.290
<i>Things haven't been good for Rock Bison this season!</i>

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:27.700
<i>It looks like we'll be able to see him in action</i>

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:28.950
<i>for the first time in quite a while!</i>

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:31.790
Huh?

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:35.790
<i>H-Hey, stop!</i>

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:39.340
<i>It seems that Rock Bison cannot pull out his horns!</i>

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.140
<i>Oh no... A taxi was hijacked!</i>

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:47.640
Oh shucks!

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:53.740
<i>Coming down from the sky is Dragon Kid,</i>

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:55.720
<i>the Lightning Bolt Kung Fu Master!</i>

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:57.460
<i>Wow!</i>

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.780
<i>She charged up her arms and released her special attack!</i>

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:04.660
<i>Two suspects are under arrest!</i>

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:09.160
<i>It's that moment we love!</i>

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:11.890
<i>And as usual, Origami Cyclone</i>

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:13.830
<i>can be seen in the background.</i>

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.460
<i>This incident is now...</i>

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:19.670
<i>Huh?</i>

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:23.010
<i>Oh no! One of the robbers is still on the run!</i>

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:30.850
Hurry up and move out!

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:34.580
<i>This is terrible! According to the information we just received,</i>

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:37.020
<i>the robber has hijacked a monorail.</i>

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.190
What's going on?
Go slower!

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:40.930
What should we do?

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:44.530
It's best not to interfere with...

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:47.290
Are you trying to ruin my program?

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.540
But the safety of the citizens...

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:50.660
Look! There...

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.560
Wow.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.710
<i>Are you sure he's okay?!</i>

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:00.160
<i>Wild Tiger, the Crusher for Justice,</i>

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.340
<i>has shown up in this terrible situation.</i>

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.660
Now cut to commercial!

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:06.640
Tiger, can you hear me?

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:09.220
Get started once the 30-second commercial is over!

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:10.780
<i>Huh? Commercial?</i>

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:17.730
I can't wait for a commercial at a time like this!

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:20.400
<i>Hey! Listen to me!</i>

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:22.610
Things will be more exciting my way!

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:23.930
<i>I don't care about that.</i>

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:31.410
We Heroes only care about keeping the peace!

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.910
Wild roar!

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:37.790
He's doing it again.

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:39.250
Continue!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:40.290
Oh, okay.

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:41.920
<i>What's this?!</i>

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:45.720
<i>Wild Tiger is activating his Hundred Power!</i>

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.840
<i>This makes his physical abilities...</i>

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:50.010
Go faster!

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:51.100
I can't.

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:53.720
<i>...a hundred times more powerful!</i>

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:54.850
Stop right now!

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:56.390
I can't!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:58.420
Stop!

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.480
Give up!

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:09.440
Huh?

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:12.080
You idiot! Below you!

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:14.460
When did he get there?

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:16.930
<i>The robber has gotten on an airship!</i>

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:22.170
<i>And here comes Sky High, the Windmaster!</i>

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:23.020
<i>Mr. Hero,</i>

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:27.090
<i>the star player this season, is on the scene!</i>

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:29.760
Go!

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:33.430
That bastard!

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.460
Showing up during the best part!

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:44.150
Don't try to stop me.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:46.400
Don't try to stop me!

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:49.610
Don't copy me!

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:03.840
<i>Oh no! The suspect's missile has exploded!</i>

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:10.450
<i>He's controlling the wind to save people first!</i>

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.220
<i>Just what we'd expect from Sky High!</i>

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:14.130
<i>He truly is the King of Heroes!</i>

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:14.970
Yay, Sky High!

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:15.490
He's so cool!

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:19.140
<i>Uh-oh! The airship just crashed into a building!</i>

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:23.490
Save me! Sky High!

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:25.230
Wild Tiger...

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:26.980
at your service!

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:30.030
Let's go!

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:31.820
No, I'll wait for Sky High.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.700
Shut up! You'll be fine with me!

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:40.640
<i>It's going to crash into a passenger boat!</i>

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:44.710
Oh boy!

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:46.740
Save us!

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:53.660
Wha—?

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:55.850
<i>Quit wasting your time.</i>

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:56.720
Huh?

00:07:56.900 --> 00:08:00.420
<i>This is the moment you fans have been waiting for!</i>

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:03.650
<i>Blue Rose, the super star of the Hero world,</i>

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:07.060
<i>has saved the passenger ship with her Freezing Liquid Gun!</i>

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:11.940
Camera B! Get a shot from below!

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:15.610
<i>My ice is a little cold,</i>

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:18.840
<i>but your crime has been put completely on hold!</i>

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:20.660
<i>She's done it!</i>

00:08:21.490 --> 00:08:23.920
Do you just want to rack up numbers?!

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:27.240
I caught the suspect here, you know!

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:32.590
Switcher!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:37.970
You...

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.890
It's your fault for interfering!

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:42.730
<i>What are you doing?</i>

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:45.730
<i>He's all right! Wild Tiger was shot, but he's all right!</i>

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:47.560
Hm? Oh.

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:49.820
Hey!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.280
Don't come this way!

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:55.100
I can't take this anymore!

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:56.160
<i>It's her explosive Cutie Escape!</i>

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:58.210
She's just running away.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:01.910
<i>What an amazing jump!</i>

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:03.300
Bastard!

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.140
<i>He's out of time!</i>

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:12.520
<i>Wild Tiger's power only lasts for five minutes!</i>

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:13.880
Oh no!

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:16.090
<i>Tiger has changed back into a normal person!</i>

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:18.720
<i>He's in danger!</i>

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:40.740
Huh?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.880
Who are you?

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.620
Don't try to push yourself.

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:50.500
<i>It's... Uh, who is he?</i>

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:56.290
Oh...

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:00.920
<i>The mystery man has arrested the suspect!</i>

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:10.900
<i>Is this the birth of a new star?</i>

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:14.030
<i>This season ends with a mysterious Hero!</i>

00:10:14.970 --> 00:10:16.160
He's so cool!
 Amazing!

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:25.660
Cut to a commercial!

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:44.040
Hey.

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:46.220
What's your affiliation?

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:47.430
Affiliation?

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:48.640
You're a free agent,

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:49.920
yet you decided to stick your neck into this?

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:51.640
What's the big idea?

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:55.150
What does it matter? We made an arrest.

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:58.040
Anyway, a Hero shouldn't remove

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:00.090
his mask in front of other people.

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:01.320
It's unheard of!

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:02.280
Huh?

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:06.700
Heroes never reveal their identities.

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:07.690
How old-fashioned.

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:08.410
Huh?

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:11.760
You've fallen behind the times, old man.

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:12.580
What?

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:22.740
<i>Everyone, thank you for waiting.</i>

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:26.840
<i>We're about to announce the results of this season's HERO TV.</i>

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:36.270
Do you realize what you've done, Kotetsu?

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:39.530
Why did you have to bend the rail?

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:42.540
And you didn't have to break the car windows, did you?

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:43.820
Well...

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.690
Then why did you break them?

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.530
Do you know how much they cost?

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:51.080
If I worried about that, I wouldn't be able to keep the peace.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:54.840
If you don't worry about that, I can't protect you!

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:56.380
Sorry for always causing you trouble.

00:11:56.660 --> 00:12:00.090
You <i>do</i> know who made you a Hero, don't you?

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.840
Our sponsors, sir!

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:06.560
Good. Now go to the award ceremony!

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:07.760
Okay!

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:12.890
<i>Fire Emblem!</i>

00:12:13.190 --> 00:12:14.190
<i>Rock Bison!</i>

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:15.610
<i>Dragon Kid!</i>

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:17.610
<i>Origami Cyclone!</i>

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:18.860
<i>Sky High!</i>

00:12:19.110 --> 00:12:20.280
<i>Blue Rose!</i>

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:21.650
<i>Wild Tiger!</i>

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.490
<i>Who's going to shine as the victor?</i>

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:25.950
You're late.

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.620
When's the MVP announcement?

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:28.540
Right now.

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:29.780
Made it in time.

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:31.410
It's definitely not you.

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.460
Shut up.

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:37.840
<i>Thank you for waiting! We are going to announce our MVP!</i>

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:54.480
<i>With 12,730 points... the King of Heroes is Sky High!</i>

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.690
<i>Congratulations.</i>

00:12:57.970 --> 00:12:59.980
<i>I couldn't have done this without everyone's help.</i>

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:03.320
<i>Thanks, and thanks again!</i>

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:14.120
<i>Next, a message from Albert Maverick,</i>

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:19.630
<i>the CEO of Apollon Media as well as the president of OBC!</i>

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:24.840
<i>Before that, there is someone I'd like to introduce.</i>

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:26.090
<i>Please come in.</i>

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:34.690
<i>Barnaby Brooks Jr. here has been officially approved</i>

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:37.150
<i>by the Justice Bureau.</i>

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:41.640
<i>He is the new Hero who will be keeping the peace in Stern Bild.</i>

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:47.480
"Heh," my ass!

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:48.660
Now, now...

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:52.980
<i>When he activates his power, he can make his physical abilities</i>

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:56.080
<i>a hundred times more powerful.</i>

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:56.830
Huh?

00:13:57.130 --> 00:13:59.330
<i>He can only activate it for five minutes at a time,</i>

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:02.710
<i>and shares the exact same power as another Hero...</i>

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:05.840
<i>But he is young!</i>

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:11.010
<i>Try not to become a Hero who needs rescuing.</i>

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:18.350
<i>Individuals with super powers, known as NEXT,</i>

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.050
<i>suddenly appeared in this world</i>

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:21.520
<i>45 years ago due to a mutation.</i>

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:25.190
<i>We still don't know what triggers these powers.</i>

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:22.770
Hey!

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:23.600
I'm leaving.

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:27.610
<i>What we do know is that peace</i>

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:30.410
<i>has been upheld in this city because these NEXT—</i>

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:33.850
<i>in other words, people with special powers,</i>

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:36.290
<i>have worked as Heroes.</i>

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:48.590
Welcome.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:54.510
"A veteran Hero... ten years since making his debut."

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:57.260
"Though he is past his prime, he still..."

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:05.150
I'd like ten of these, ma'am!

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:06.480
Okay.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:13.070
What's up?

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.790
Hey, aren't you going to come to the celebration?

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.910
<i>I don't really care for those things.</i>

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:21.170
You should greet the bigwigs.

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:23.570
<i>Then you take care of that for me.</i>

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:25.420
Oh, hey!

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:30.550
Your butt always feels nice.

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:33.210
Y-You idiot! Get away from me!

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:35.930
The way you showed up in the background was splendid.

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:37.580
I want you to do it again next time.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:42.410
I'll try to bring the spotlight on the company name. I mean, I will.

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:45.810
President, my catch phrase is embarrassing.

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:47.220
Can I change it?

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:50.030
That domineering attitude is what makes you so popular.

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:52.240
You just don't get it, do you?

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:55.580
Thanks, and thanks again!

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:56.950
Mr. Maverick!

00:15:57.660 --> 00:16:02.670
Making you the producer of this program was the right choice.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.500
I never expected you to pull in these ratings.

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:10.630
I, Agnes Joubert, will make it much more intense!

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:13.720
Coming, coming, coming...

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:19.060
Hello?

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:19.930
<i>Dad?</i>

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:22.410
Hey! What is it, Kaede?

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:26.270
You haven't forgotten about my recital tomorrow, have you?

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:27.570
Of course not!

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:29.280
I promised that I'd be there.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:29.990
Ouch!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:33.960
Really? You don't have to work?

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.160
<i>It's all right!</i>

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:40.720
Tomorrow, I'm going to get a good look at how cute you are!

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:42.460
I wouldn't miss it!

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:43.850
<i>Oh, is that so?</i>

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:48.340
You should tell me that you've taken the phone, Mom!

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:51.250
I was watching the TV. Do you have to pay for damages again?

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:56.550
You get reckless when you get worked up. Be careful.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.010
I know.

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:00.180
<i>Anyway, if you die,</i>

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:05.440
<i>I'm going to have to tell Kaede that her father was a Hero.</i>

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:07.520
<i>I really want you to be careful.</i>

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.440
You worry too much.

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:11.440
<i>I can't help it!</i>

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:14.330
<i>You have to keep your work a secret from your own daughter.</i>

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:16.950
<i>It would be strange if I didn't worry.</i>

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:20.290
Yeah I know... I know.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:28.290
What?!

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:30.890
Sorry, Kotetsu.

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:32.380
Ben...

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:34.580
A buyout?

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.550
Big money is involved.

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:41.180
We were struggling with funds, so we found a good buyer.

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:42.310
Here.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:43.140
Huh?

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.730
Who is this guy?

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:46.690
Your new boss.

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:47.600
Huh?

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:50.150
Go say hello right now.

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:53.560
Wait a second. I don't understand what's going on.

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:55.400
Starting next season,

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:58.760
only the seven major companies are going to have Heroes.

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:02.120
And our company was the last one to go.

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:04.370
In other words, we're going to disappear?

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:06.660
You don't need to know this.

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:09.000
Did the other Heroes know about this?

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:13.000
Was I the only one who didn't know?

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:14.340
Sorry.

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:17.010
What are you going to do?

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.920
Don't worry about me.

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:21.510
I'm going to take it easy on unemployment insurance

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:23.220
and look for another job.

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:25.640
I can't go by myself.

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:26.730
It's all right.

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:27.770
But...

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:30.310
It's all right.

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:35.060
Not being able to see you fight as a Hero is much worse.

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:41.200
I'll always be a fan of Wild Tiger. Got it?

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:02.550
This is the place, eh?

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:13.610
There we go!

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:19.700
Here.

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:21.070
Thank you.

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:23.740
You dropped those.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:26.500
Oh. Those are...

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:29.250
Say, mister... Are you...

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:32.170
Darn, you figured it out?

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:34.590
You like Tiger, don't you?!

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:37.440
Huh?

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:40.090
In that case, I'll give you this.

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:43.340
You don't have to do that. This is your treasure, isn't it?

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:46.560
I'm a Sky High fan, so I don't need it. You can have it.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:47.570
Is that so?

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:53.100
I see. I'm unwanted...

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:00.650
Are you Wild Tiger?

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:04.370
You got Tiger from your name Toratetsu, huh?

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:07.040
It's Kotetsu. Kaburagi Kotetsu.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:12.010
You will be briefed about your suit

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:13.960
at the Development Department.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:16.920
Well, I hadn't heard that we were doing this today.

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:19.380
You can quit if you don't want to.

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:20.630
I'll do it.

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:25.180
Is it the industrial district?

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.390
The Steel Hammer Statue?

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:30.140
Why is it moving?

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:32.230
A NEXT might be behind this.

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:34.230
All right, head out right away.

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:36.810
Huh? But I don't have a suit.

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:39.230
I have one for you right here.

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:44.530
I want you to make use of your new suit.

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:47.830
I can't do that... sir.

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:50.410
Do you have a problem with it?

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.710
I have no intention of wearing any suit other than my own.

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:55.500
Don't worry.

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:58.670
The specs on this one are far better than the one you wore.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:05.010
That's not the issue here. I need to wear that suit to be a Hero!

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.960
It's what I aspire to become...

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:09.970
Just get going already.

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:29.410
Actually, this is nice.

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:33.370
It's him.

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:34.300
All right...

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:36.210
One important thing.

00:21:36.300 --> 00:21:39.040
I'm going to pair you up with another Hero.

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:39.920
Huh?

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:42.340
The first team in the Hero world...

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:44.690
That's what Apollon Media is going to sell.

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:46.630
I hadn't heard about that.

00:21:46.680 --> 00:21:49.050
If you don't like it, you can quit.

00:21:52.300 --> 00:21:55.920
What's this about a team?! Who am I pairing up with?

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:02.660
That hurts... I guess I can't do this by myself.

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:04.410
Huh? You?!

00:22:20.890 --> 00:22:25.840
boku ga kie tooi mirai de kaseki ni nattara

00:22:20.890 --> 00:22:25.840
<i>When I die and become a fossil in the far future,</i>

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:31.080
hito wa boku ni nani wo miru darou?

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:31.080
<i>what will people see me as?</i>

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:36.080
bunseki shite na wo tsukete kaidoku wo shitemo

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:36.080
<i>They may try to analyze, name, and understand me,</i>

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:41.520
aishita hito wa boku shika shiranai

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:41.520
<i>but only I will know the person I loved.</i>

00:22:41.300 --> 00:22:46.030
HELLO ikiru koto

00:22:41.300 --> 00:22:46.030
<i>Hello, existence.</i>

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:51.480
kimi no hoka ni kimi wa dekinai

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:51.480
<i>Only you alone can live your life.</i>

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:56.540
kagayaki tsuzukeru hikatta hoshi kara

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:56.540
<i>From the bright star that continues to shine,</i>

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:02.550
kagayaki tsuzuke hikatta ano sora kara

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:02.550
<i>from that bright sky that continues to shine.</i>

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:06.570
bokura wa nani wo kanjirareru darou?

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:06.570
<i>What can we feel from it?</i>

00:23:06.310 --> 00:23:11.880
kiseki wa uchuu dake janai yo

00:23:06.310 --> 00:23:11.880
<i>The universe isn't the only miracle.</i>

00:23:11.730 --> 00:23:16.900
kagayaki tsuzukeru hikatta hoshi kara

00:23:11.730 --> 00:23:16.900
<i>From the bright star that continues to shine,</i>

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:22.930
kagayaki tsuzuke hikatta ano sora kara

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:22.930
<i>from that bright sky that continues to shine.</i>

00:23:23.090 --> 00:23:27.020
me wo tojitatte tojikirenaiyo

00:23:23.090 --> 00:23:27.020
<i>You can try to shut your eyes, but you can't shut out your heart.</i>

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:34.920
ano hoshi sae motenakatta kokoro

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:34.920
<i>It's something that even the stars did not possess.</i>

00:23:36.890 --> 00:23:39.160
Huh? Really? With you, Rock Bison?

00:23:40.260 --> 00:23:40.980
Huh?

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:42.790
What do you mean, "Huh"?

00:23:42.840 --> 00:23:44.460
You're my—

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:51.880
Let's go, old man!

00:23:54.170 --> 00:23:55.390
You?!

00:24:00.980 --> 00:24:04.770
Hello! I'm Kotetsu, the bearded member of "Tiger & Bunny"!

00:24:04.970 --> 00:24:08.730
Whoa! A statue is going wild! Is a NEXT behind this?

00:24:08.880 --> 00:24:10.700
Next time on TIGER & BUNNY:

00:24:13.700 --> 00:24:14.940
I don't know what this says!
